    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c035201da4024792601ad277",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "嗯，这个吗？这个叫『Pak Pet Tod』。\n『Pak』是嘴，『Tod』是炸……『Pet』是鸭子。",
      "source_fingerprint": "70e924709526638e3e067f483a0a950151c3a6593cc9af43cdd8aafa04226d9a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1135/storytimeline_041135006.json",
      "json_path": [
