    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21f3bff1221163a0984e53e6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "简单来说，就是『炸鸭嘴』。\n吃起来像仙贝一样，味道挺不错的哦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "458346ec4ed58b1a26a1b06f0ba0fedd05df3399a92dd719702512bd45977f92",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1135/storytimeline_041135006.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        25,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/25/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d7b6331dbca026e418a7d4c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "经她这么一说，确实是鸭嘴……或者该说，\n形状看起来就像是从下方看到的鸭子头部。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f08dd81458e843aa0286332bdd172a0559eb3b46c64e26fb1e7905049e6748a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1135/storytimeline_041135006.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        26,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/26/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d592af2dfb8cf5de105b413c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……哦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2e1c3b8c99899f22f08e3adbd8714a9a8ea0111ce611a68e5cb1e430aff3046",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1135/storytimeline_041135006.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        27,
        "choice_data_list",
