      "uid": "zhcn:f3188e5ba2c831f23b8352de",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "本以为会是某种怪异的味道，结果却在好的意义上出乎意料。\n然后，灵光一闪。",
      "source_fingerprint": "79e9558c746d393a70ca19c25e0bc98be30f70d6a3ae60e63b927edc73af5cd4",
